From d47cd6ffb787c37be727ecf021187dfebc471413 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:02:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(web): adapt client and e2e suites after group chat
 removal

- delete 23 group-chat client suites, the desktop agent-link popup test
  and the two group chat e2e specs
- retarget suites that only borrowed group chat fixtures: api error
  mapping, login redirect, router redirect, agent manager route slice,
  sidebar conversation-switch order, style system (three-way switch,
  custom-background selectors), global pending actions, files store /
  files panel attach, markdown image resolver, TTS autoplay call sites,
  drawer resize seams, ekko display name, i18n coverage, history deeplink
  (no group rooms in history) and the shared e2e API fixtures
